# Python bytecode. The Hermes asset and its two harnesses are Python, and
# running either harness leaves a __pycache__ beside the asset. Sidecar embeds
# the source files by name, so a compiled copy is never shipped and never
# belongs in a commit.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
